00:12:58,833 --> 00:13:02,667
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You guys know Captain Sinclair,
Internal Affairs' top watchdog.</b></font>

153
00:13:02,769 --> 00:13:05,602
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'd actually take that as a compliment
if I didn't know you so well.</b></font>

154
00:13:05,705 --> 00:13:10,109
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Excuse me, but if you two want to
get personal, I could step out...</b></font>

155
00:13:10,245 --> 00:13:12,941
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>There's nothing personal here. I'm just doing my job.</b></font>

156
00:13:13,049 --> 00:13:14,482
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I love knowing that one leak...</b></font>

157
00:13:14,584 --> 00:13:17,985
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>one headline could turn this nightmare into a media frenzy.</b></font>

158
00:13:18,088 --> 00:13:21,855
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That won't happen. We'll get the
dope back before that ever happens.</b></font>

159
00:13:21,959 --> 00:13:23,654
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Good. Start by looking right here.</b></font>

160
00:13:23,762 --> 00:13:27,698
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This had to be an inside job, and I'll find out about it.</b></font>

161
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:30,830
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Sanchez, Ruiz, you're late.</b></font>

162
00:13:33,372 --> 00:13:37,139
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Somebody put this in for toxic drug fumes.</b></font>

163
00:13:37,245 --> 00:13:39,110
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah, this was a brilliant design.</b></font>

164
00:13:39,213 --> 00:13:41,340
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This was really intelligent. I like this.</b></font>

165
00:13:41,451 --> 00:13:44,215
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I didn't ask how he feels. I said, "What did he see?"</b></font>

166
00:13:44,319 --> 00:13:46,253
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What does he know?</b></font>

167
00:13:47,792 --> 00:13:49,259
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Where were y'all last night?</b></font>

168
00:13:49,392 --> 00:13:52,691
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Listen, why don't ya'll have your cousins
bring the shit back, and we can all get some sleep.</b></font>

169
00:13:52,797 --> 00:13:55,698
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We were gonna do that, but we came up with a problem.</b></font>

170
00:13:55,801 --> 00:13:58,133
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Your mama snorted up all the dope.</b></font>

171
00:13:58,237 --> 00:13:59,865
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You two, get over there.</b></font>

172
00:14:02,476 --> 00:14:05,036
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>O'Fee will be all right, but he's got nothing to tell us.</b></font>

173
00:14:05,146 --> 00:14:08,707
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>So they kill a decoy, it empties the station. Very smart.</b></font>

174
00:14:08,851 --> 00:14:12,253
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But they don't kill a real cop because
they had the whole force on their ass.</b></font>

175
00:14:12,353 --> 00:14:15,186
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This was your case. You're back on it.</b></font>

176
00:14:15,291 --> 00:14:18,692
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Sanchez, Ruiz, you back them up with whatever they need.</b></font>

177
00:14:18,829 --> 00:14:21,389
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Shut your mouths.
- But wait a second.</b></font>

178
00:14:21,498 --> 00:14:23,591
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It was Carrera's drugs in the first place.</b></font>

179
00:14:23,701 --> 00:14:25,863
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But it couldn't have been him
because he was killed in prison.</b></font>

180
00:14:25,971 --> 00:14:27,768
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What about the rest of his crew?</b></font>

181
00:14:27,871 --> 00:14:29,839
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Those idiots don't have the precision to do this, but...</b></font>

182
00:14:29,974 --> 00:14:32,238
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>just in case I'm wrong, you check them out.</b></font>

183
00:14:32,343 --> 00:14:36,370
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>They'd have been up here with Uzis,
splashing O'Fee all over the place.</b></font>

184
00:14:36,515 --> 00:14:38,211
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Takes a lot of brains to pull this off.</b></font>

185
00:14:38,350 --> 00:14:42,309
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Big cojones too.
- What the hell are you talking about? "Cojones"?</b></font>

186
00:14:42,456 --> 00:14:45,425
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It would take me a month to explain to you what cojones is.</b></font>

187
00:14:45,526 --> 00:14:47,551
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- You're in Miami. You don't know...
- In English.</b></font>

188
00:14:48,032 --> 00:14:50,659
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Ho! Ho! <i>Hey!</i>
We've got nothing.</b></font>

189
00:14:50,810 --> 00:14:54,333
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What's the matter with you? We've got nothing!</b></font>

190
00:14:54,333 --> 00:14:56,605
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The guy who pulled this off knew what he was doing...</b></font>

191
00:14:56,707 --> 00:14:59,107
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and he left us nothing but a big "Fuck you."</b></font>

192
00:14:59,723 --> 00:15:04,201
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Ruiz, Sanchez, find out who installed
the ventilating system. Do that now.</b></font>

193
00:15:06,885 --> 00:15:09,445
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- That's cold.
- Yeah, so is your mama's bed.</b></font>

194
00:15:09,554 --> 00:15:11,852
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This could definitely be an inside job. Don't rule it out.</b></font>

195
00:15:13,225 --> 00:15:16,627
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We've got 72 hours before the FBI and the DEA...</b></font>

196
00:15:16,732 --> 00:15:20,133
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>walk in here and shut us down, and we'll be the bad guys.</b></font>

197
00:15:20,235 --> 00:15:23,261
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Politics demand that somebody take the rap for this.</b></font>

198
00:15:23,406 --> 00:15:28,674
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's going to be us. Just do what you do, only faster.</b></font>

199
00:15:28,779 --> 00:15:30,474
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Jo Jo, what's up?</b></font>

200
00:15:30,580 --> 00:15:33,640
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You're still a chemist, right?
Cutting drugs and shit like that?</b></font>

201
00:15:33,751 --> 00:15:37,653
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I don't know nothing about that.
I'm out of the drug business.</b></font>

202
00:15:37,757 --> 00:15:39,783
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- You know something.
- You don't know nothing?</b></font>

203
00:15:39,926 --> 00:15:41,689
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I just said no to drugs.</b></font>

204
00:15:41,794 --> 00:15:46,094
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- What are you into, Jo?
- Rubber, rubber, rubber.</b></font>

205
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:49,499
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- You're selling tires? - Yeah.</b></font>

206
00:15:49,638 --> 00:15:53,598
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Jo Jo don't know nothing.
- Nothing. I know tires.</b></font>

207
00:15:53,707 --> 00:15:57,143
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- You're telling me the truth, right?
- Would I lie to you?</b></font>

208
00:15:57,277 --> 00:15:59,006
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Would you lie to me?
- I'm driving.</b></font>

209
00:16:06,623 --> 00:16:09,820
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Man, this is a waste of time.
- Come on, man.</b></font>

210
00:16:09,961 --> 00:16:13,419
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>In Max's line of work, she definitely gets the 411.</b></font>

211
00:16:13,564 --> 00:16:17,159
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Maxi! How did I know I would find you up in here?</b></font>

212
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:23,540
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We have to talk. Is there someplace we can go?</b></font>

213
00:16:23,677 --> 00:16:25,304
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah. Equipment room?</b></font>

214
00:16:25,446 --> 00:16:27,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Behave yourself.
- I'm cool.</b></font>

215
00:16:38,695 --> 00:16:41,755
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Listen, I need some help, again.</b></font>

216
00:16:41,866 --> 00:16:43,357
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What else is new?</b></font>

217
00:16:54,881 --> 00:16:58,875
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Major ill shit happened down at the police department.</b></font>

218
00:16:59,021 --> 00:17:01,717
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>There's a lot of heroin involved.
There will be a lot of cash involved.</b></font>

219
00:17:01,824 --> 00:17:05,089
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>There will definitely be some jolly young
men running around who want to party.</b></font>

220
00:17:05,194 --> 00:17:06,718
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What do you need?</b></font>

221
00:17:06,863 --> 00:17:09,230
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>A lot of people will talk to you that won't talk to me.</b></font>

222
00:17:09,334 --> 00:17:12,269
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You mean customers?</b></font>

223
00:17:12,370 --> 00:17:14,895
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm not asking you to get into any wild shit.</b></font>

224
00:17:15,039 --> 00:17:19,305
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Just call me if you hear something.
- I think I will call you.</b></font>

225
00:17:28,754 --> 00:17:31,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What the hell are you doing?</b></font>

226
00:17:31,358 --> 00:17:33,327
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Trying to keep my shit quick.</b></font>

227
00:17:33,428 --> 00:17:34,918
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's right. You ain't getting none at home.</b></font>

228
00:17:35,063 --> 00:17:37,429
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You got extra energy. Go ahead. Burn it off, baby.</b></font>

229
00:17:39,702 --> 00:17:41,397
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We got anything, Francine?</b></font>

230
00:17:41,503 --> 00:17:44,097
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Sanchez says the air-conditioning contract went...</b></font>

231
00:17:44,238 --> 00:17:46,799
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- to Manuel Arrona of Key Biscayne.
- Partner.</b></font>

232
00:17:46,944 --> 00:17:50,937
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He's working out of his house this week. That's the number.</b></font>

233
00:17:57,925 --> 00:17:59,790
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He's not answering.</b></font>

234
00:17:59,893 --> 00:18:02,123
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I guess we should just leave.</b></font>

235
00:18:02,229 --> 00:18:06,222
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What? Make a trip all the way down
here to high society for nothing?</b></font>

236
00:18:06,367 --> 00:18:07,959
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's why they have windows.</b></font>

237
00:18:08,102 --> 00:18:09,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- We can peek in. - Yeah, that should do it.</b></font>

238
00:18:15,379 --> 00:18:17,813
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I tripped.
- The handle just opened?</b></font>

239
00:18:17,948 --> 00:18:19,643
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Right after I tripped, it just opened.</b></font>

240
00:18:19,750 --> 00:18:23,983
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I guess they want us to come in, take a peek.</b></font>

241
00:18:24,123 --> 00:18:26,318
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hello?</b></font>

242
00:18:26,426 --> 00:18:28,792
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We're your new neighbors.</b></font>

243
00:18:28,895 --> 00:18:31,420
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Don't be alarmed. We're Negroes.</b></font>

244
00:18:31,531 --> 00:18:34,329
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Man, there's too much bass in your voice.</b></font>

245
00:18:34,434 --> 00:18:36,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That scares white folks. You've got to sound like them.</b></font>

246
00:18:37,072 --> 00:18:40,667
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We were wondering if we could borrow some brown sugar?</b></font>

247
00:18:47,314 --> 00:18:50,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- You fart?
- No, man...</b></font>

248
00:18:51,955 --> 00:18:53,752
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Dead guy.</b></font>

249
00:19:04,169 --> 00:19:06,034
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Looks like somebody's home.</b></font>

250
00:19:16,185 --> 00:19:18,881
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Let me take a stab at this one.</b></font>

251
00:19:18,987 --> 00:19:21,581
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He sells the ventilation plans to the bad guys.</b></font>

252
00:19:21,690 --> 00:19:25,057
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- He gets rich, but he gets dead.
- You're right on that one.</b></font>

253
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:28,187
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I'll go call Homicide.
- Whoa. Wait.</b></font>

254
00:19:28,299 --> 00:19:30,426
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Why do you act like this every
time we're around a dead body?</b></font>

255
00:19:30,535 --> 00:19:33,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's cool. I just...</b></font>

256
00:19:33,104 --> 00:19:35,265
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Please, look around.</b></font>

257
00:19:36,508 --> 00:19:39,103
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The smell and the fumes...</b></font>

258
00:19:39,214 --> 00:19:41,114
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's just unexpected, that's all.</b></font>

259
00:19:50,825 --> 00:19:53,624
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Looks like our buddy Arrona was a bit of a gambler.</b></font>

260
00:19:53,729 --> 00:19:55,594
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He's got dog track, jai alai.</b></font>

261
00:19:55,664 --> 00:19:57,461
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Probably needed the money to pay off his debts.</b></font>

262
00:19:57,567 --> 00:19:58,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Bookie.</b></font>

263
00:20:02,241 --> 00:20:04,267
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Whoops.
- Damn, man.</b></font>

264
00:20:04,409 --> 00:20:06,206
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Watch where you're swinging a dead leg.</b></font>

265
00:20:06,311 --> 00:20:07,778
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>My bad.</b></font>

266
00:20:07,882 --> 00:20:10,544
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Damn this. I'm calling Homicide.</b></font>

267
00:20:10,648 --> 00:20:12,513
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm a narcotics cop.</b></font>

268
00:20:15,388 --> 00:20:17,516
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Dead bodies.</b></font>

269
00:20:19,026 --> 00:20:21,119
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Dead ends.</b></font>

270
00:20:27,268 --> 00:20:29,169
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Maggots.</b></font>

271
00:20:32,275 --> 00:20:35,972
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- What's wrong with you?
- A little nauseous...</b></font>

272
00:20:36,079 --> 00:20:40,209
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm gonna...</b></font>

273
00:20:48,261 --> 00:20:49,888
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What do you say we grab a couple burritos?</b></font>

274
00:20:52,799 --> 00:20:56,167
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You drive almost slow enough to drive Miss Daisy.</b></font>

275
00:20:58,607 --> 00:21:01,599
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Man, the transaction is done, all right?</b></font>

276
00:21:01,710 --> 00:21:04,110
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- We ain't got shit, so it's over.
- Relax.</b></font>

277
00:21:04,213 --> 00:21:06,682
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We got it before. We'll get it again.</b></font>

278
00:21:06,785 --> 00:21:09,345
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah, you got it all figured out, don't you?</b></font>

279
00:21:09,454 --> 00:21:11,183
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You got to have faith, player.</b></font>

280
00:21:11,323 --> 00:21:14,815
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>By the time we figured out how, we'd be out of a job.</b></font>

281
00:21:14,927 --> 00:21:19,365
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, scratch that. Everybody in
the damn unit will be out of a job.</b></font>

282
00:21:19,466 --> 00:21:24,460
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But don't worry. They tend to
think Mike Lowrey will be all right.</b></font>

283
00:21:24,571 --> 00:21:28,735
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Especially since they think you some rich kid playing cop.</b></font>

284
00:21:28,843 --> 00:21:32,177
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Look, man, I ain't got no trust fund.</b></font>

285
00:21:32,283 --> 00:21:35,719
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>For me: No job, no check.</b></font>

286
00:21:35,816 --> 00:21:39,912
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's like all the other guys in the unit. Most of us.</b></font>

287
00:21:40,021 --> 00:21:42,046
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>So I'm playing cop now?</b></font>

288
00:21:43,325 --> 00:21:45,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This is a game. I'm just joking around.</b></font>

289
00:21:45,596 --> 00:21:48,064
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You always wanted to be Starsky or Hutch.</b></font>

290
00:21:50,601 --> 00:21:54,901
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Know what? I'm so sick of this bullshit.</b></font>

291
00:21:55,007 --> 00:21:58,535
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm supposed to apologize for
my family leaving me money?</b></font>

292
00:21:58,646 --> 00:22:01,240
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>All I ever wanted to be was a cop.</b></font>

293
00:22:01,382 --> 00:22:03,850
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I get up early and take it to the max every day.</b></font>

294
00:22:03,951 --> 00:22:07,250
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm the first guy through the door
and the last to leave the crime scene...</b></font>

295
00:22:07,355 --> 00:22:09,586
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>so fuck you and fuck them...</b></font>

296
00:22:09,692 --> 00:22:12,923
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and fuck everybody who got a problem with Mike Lowrey.</b></font>

297
00:22:15,198 --> 00:22:17,666
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I love you, man.
- Fuck you, Marcus.</b></font>

298
00:22:20,438 --> 00:22:24,432
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I do. You're cool with me. You're my partner.</b></font>

299
00:22:24,544 --> 00:22:27,707
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Shut up. Slow-ass driver.</b></font>

300
00:22:27,814 --> 00:22:29,714
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Driving like a bitch.
- Why I got to be all that?</b></font>

301
